{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/T_Button.gif?t=1746400057\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/tolom-parallax2.gif?t=1746400057\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TOLOM</strong> is a turn-based deckbuilding roguelike. You play as Tolom, a wandering soul hiding inside a small bell, trying to escape the grasp of a dark presence threatening to consume everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a suit at the start of your journey\u2014each one defines a unique playstyle and offers a different way to approach combat. Fight using consumable cards: each one is spent when player, so every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore open maps with complete freedom. Decide what to face, when to buy new cards, and when to confront the final challenge. Falling doesn\u2019t mean giving up\u2014try again with a new strategy and uncover what lies beyond the miasma.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deckbuilding with fully consumable cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic and challenging turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suits that define your playstyle from the beginning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open exploration and non-linear progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High replayability with meaningful choices and varied paths</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688210?t=1746400057","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/5d02bc6b7be9257d4d6758d348d1aa36f445f6ff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746400057","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/a32eda451c54950b71175f839f381a9fb298d396/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746400057","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/a32eda451c54950b71175f839f381a9fb298d396/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746400057","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/T_Button.gif?t=1746400057\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/extras/tolom-parallax2.gif?t=1746400057\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TOLOM</strong> is a turn-based deckbuilding roguelike. You play as Tolom, a wandering soul hiding inside a small bell, trying to escape the grasp of a dark presence threatening to consume everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a suit at the start of your journey\u2014each one defines a unique playstyle and offers a different way to approach combat. Fight using consumable cards: each one is spent when player, so every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore open maps with complete freedom. Decide what to face, when to buy new cards, and when to confront the final challenge. Falling doesn\u2019t mean giving up\u2014try again with a new strategy and uncover what lies beyond the miasma.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deckbuilding with fully consumable cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic and challenging turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suits that define your playstyle from the beginning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open exploration and non-linear progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High replayability with meaningful choices and varied paths</p></li></ul>","developers":["Inkrow Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/018c20d3c61a329e3c5fadc6d6d4d7c1f71d5b6f/header.jpg?t=1746400057","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"TOLOM","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB RAM, OpenGL 3.3</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB RAM, OpenGL 4.5</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Inkrow Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/caaccae8b52fe1d0da813ce654b003b735780ddb/ss_caaccae8b52fe1d0da813ce654b003b735780ddb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746400057","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/caaccae8b52fe1d0da813ce654b003b735780ddb/ss_caaccae8b52fe1d0da813ce654b003b735780ddb.600x338.jpg?t=1746400057"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688210/076cb70309ad79a1fb0c63b0e7309d57ad42ee86/ss_076cb70